[2026-11-27T11:58:51Z] note: sanity check: spec defaults IS: 94 trades, -1.85 %/yr, max DD -15.46 % (OOS 94 trades, -1.59 %/yr, DD -16.04 %). Verified on generated trades (ratio_zscore, normalized_distance, ratio_rsi): every entry follows an entry signal on the previous bar with no exit signal; signal exits follow an exit signal; after an exit no fill on the same bar (e.g. KO/PEP stopped 2008-07-01, next entry 2008-07-03); sum of trade P&L = equity change (-769.93 over 'all'); borrow fee lowers results monotonically (0 / 0.25 / 3 %/yr -> IS net 466 / 450 / 282). Engle-Granger p at MacKinnon's 5 % critical value (-3.34, N=2) = 0.0495.
